##: {{ux|en|Whenever things get tough, she cuts and '''runs'''.}}
##: {{ux|en|When he's broke, he '''runs''' to me for money.}}
## {{lb|en|figurative|transitive}} To [[pass]] (without [[stop]]ping), typically a stop [[signal]], [[stop sign]]{{,}} or [[duty]] to [[yield]] the [[right of way]].
