# {{lb|en|fluids}} To flow.
## {{lb|en|intransitive}} Of a [[liquid]], to [[flow]].
##: {{ux|en|The river '''runs''' through the forest.}}
##: {{ux|en|There's blood '''running''' down your leg.}}
## {{lb|en|intransitive|figuratively}} To move or [[spread]] quickly.
##: {{ux|en|There's a strange story '''running''' around the neighborhood.}}
##: {{ux|en|The flu is '''running''' through my daughter's kindergarten.}}
